DATA AND SERVICES
-----------------
The ids below are the ids used in data/attribution.json, docs/ATTRIBUTION.md and
GET /api/v1/attribution. Usage terms are copied from the registry. Where the
registry says "pending-source", the terms have not yet been read and confirmed
by a human, and this NOTICE does not claim any.

horizons       JPL Horizons System, API. NASA/JPL Solar System Dynamics.
               https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/horizons/
               Usage statement: pending-source (issue #16). Citation: pending-source.

trek-moon      Moon Trek WMTS. NASA/JPL Solar System Treks.
               https://trek.nasa.gov/moon/
               Usage statement: layer metadata Use_Constraints and Access_Constraints
               say None; the Trek terms page is pending-source (human check).
               Credit: per layer, the Credit field of its FGDC metadata, shown beside
               the map.

quickmap       LROC QuickMap. LROC team (Arizona State University), hosted by
               Intuitive Machines. https://quickmap.lroc.im-ldi.com/
               Used for manual validation and "Open in QuickMap" links only.
               Usage statement: pending-source (issue #16). Citation: pending-source.

csa-moon       Moon exploration. Canadian Space Agency.
               https://www.asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/astronomy/moon-exploration/
               Credit: Canadian Space Agency. Paraphrased blurbs link to the source
               page. The CSA terms page (https://www.asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/terms.asp)
               grants reproduction for personal, educational or informational
               non-commercial use with CSA acknowledged, accuracy care and no implied
               endorsement; the CSA logo is not reused. Human confirmation of fit is
               recorded in the registry as A1.

lola-dem       High-Resolution LOLA Topography for Lunar South Pole Sites (5 m/px
               GeoTIFF). NASA GSFC PGDA (M. K. Barker, LRO-LOLA).
               https://pgda.gsfc.nasa.gov/products/78
               Citation: Barker et al., 2021, Planetary and Space Science 203, 105119,
               https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pss.2020.105119
               Usage statement: pending-source (NASA public product, terms page not yet
               read by a human).

nssdc-apollo   Apollo Lunar Landings (1969 - 1972) table. NASA GSFC NSSDCA.
               https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/planetary/lunar/apolloland.html
               Usage statement: pending-source.

nasa-clps      Commercial Lunar Payload Services Deliveries. NASA Science.
               https://science.nasa.gov/lunar-science/clps-deliveries/
               Usage statement: pending-source.

The data sources above are listed in the registry as of the commit that adds this
file; if the registry changes, data/attribution.json is authoritative.

SOFTWARE
--------
Third-party software keeps its own licences. The full generated inventory is in
docs/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md (regenerate with python scripts/gen_licenses.py).
Items that need attention are listed in the table at the top of that file,
notably psycopg (LGPL-3.0-only, used unmodified as a library), several MPL-2.0
packages (used unmodified) and two OFL-1.1 web fonts (Sora and IBM Plex Mono via
@fontsource, self-hosted).
